TITLE: Heracles HVPS Interface Application FW Verification Testing Protocol
UID: DHF-HRC-0101

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document provides the full test protocol (a full collection of test cases) for the HVPS Interface
Application Firmware for the Heracles 1.0 system.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This report contains a detailed test description to conduct verification testing of Heracles 1.0 HVPS
Interface Application Firmware that covers Heracles HVPS Interface Application FW SRS.
<<<

