[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H1FWHVPS-25
TITLE: Cathode current limiter setpoint - Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
When user powered on the system, load and run a 20 second treatment plan, verify the treatment
plan run and finished without any types of faults.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
* The system is powered on and ready to use.
* A treatment plan should be ready to load.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Power on the system.
2. Load a 20 second treatment plan.
3. Start to run the loaded plan.
4. Wait for 20 seconds.
5. Click Logs symbol in the left panel of the screen.
6. Check the logs of the running treatment plan.
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
1. Verify the system is powered on successfully.
2. Verify the plan is loaded successfully.
3. Verify the emission and run is started successfully without any issues.
4. Verify the running of the plan is finished without any issues.
5. Verify the logs displayed in the middle of the screen.
6. Verify there is not any error or emission current fault in the logs related to the latest run of the loaded treatment plan. Also, verify there is not any kV output fault in the logs.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H1FWHVPS-9
  ROLE: Verifies

[TEST_CASE]
UID: TC-H1FWHVPS-26
TITLE: Cathode current feedback - Test Case
STATEMENT: >>>
When user powered on the system, load and run a 20 second treatment plan, verify user can
record the emission/cathode current value at approximately 5 seconds and approximately 15
seconds which is provided by firmware application.
<<<
PREREQUISITES: >>>
* The system is powered on and ready to use.
* A treatment plan should be ready to load.
<<<
STEPS: >>>
1. Power on the system.
2. Load a 20 second treatment plan.
3. Start the emission.
4. Wait for 5 seconds.
5. Wait another 10 seconds.
<<<
EXPECTED_BEHAVIOR: >>>
1. Verify the system is powered on successfully.
2. Verify the plan is loaded successfully.
3. Verify the emission started.
4. Record the emission/cathode current which is provided by firmware application.
5. Record the emission/cathode current which is provided by firmware application.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H1FWHVPS-10
  ROLE: Verifies

